WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:20.008
Bobby walked into the gym just as Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

2
00:00:20.009 --> 00:00:22.604
"Line up!" she said.

3
00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:24.966
"We're going outside."

4
00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:28.888
She was carrying a bag of baseballs.

5
00:00:28.889 --> 00:00:35.700
"Today is going to be fun!" Bobby thought.

6
00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:40.989
Bobby saw a batting tee on the blacktop.

7
00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:44.680
"Are we playing T-ball?" he asked.

8
00:00:44.681 --> 00:00:50.328
"Oh, I'm terrible at T-ball," Izzie groaned.

9
00:00:50.329 --> 00:00:55.765
"We're having a T-ball Home Run Derby," Miss Shelly said.

10
00:00:55.766 --> 00:01:01.708
"All right!" Bobby and Ethan gave each other high fives.

11
00:01:01.709 --> 00:01:05.320
"What's a home run derby?" Nina asked.

12
00:01:05.321 --> 00:01:09.823
"It's the best part of baseball season!" Bobby said.

13
00:01:09.824 --> 00:01:14.011
"It's when the players have a home run contest."

14
00:01:14.012 --> 00:01:19.079
"You each get three tries to hit the ball," Miss Shelly explained.

15
00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:23.307
"The ball must go past that blue line to be a home run."

16
00:01:23.308 --> 00:01:26.269
She pointed to a line on the blacktop.

17
00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:31.982
"The person who hits the most home runs wins," Bobby added.

18
00:01:31.983 --> 00:01:36.718
"Who wants to go first?" Miss Shelly asked. "Bobby?"

19
00:01:36.719 --> 00:01:43.690
"Usually the worst person goes first," Bobby said.

20
00:01:43.691 --> 00:01:48.978
"I'll go," Nina offered. "I'm probably the worst."

21
00:01:48.979 --> 00:01:51.092
Miss Shelly frowned.

22
00:01:51.093 --> 00:01:56.317
"There's no best or worst here, Bobby."

23
00:01:56.318 --> 00:01:59.184
Miss Shelly set the ball on the tee.

24
00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:02.193
"Whenever you're ready!" she called.

25
00:02:02.194 --> 00:02:06.193
Nina gripped the bat and swung. She missed!

26
00:02:06.194 --> 00:02:09.802
She swung again. Another miss!

27
00:02:09.803 --> 00:02:13.456
On her last try, she missed again.

28
00:02:13.457 --> 00:02:17.558
"Your score is zero!" Bobby said.

29
00:02:17.559 --> 00:02:21.945
"Bobby, that's not nice," Miss Shelly scolded.

30
00:02:21.946 --> 00:02:24.928
"I'll go next," Jason said.

31
00:02:24.929 --> 00:02:27.354
"I'm not very good either."

32
00:02:27.355 --> 00:02:31.880
He stepped up to the tee.

33
00:02:31.881 --> 00:02:37.030
On his third try, he hit the ball!

34
00:02:37.031 --> 00:02:41.611
"Home run!" Jason cried, jumping up and down.

35
00:02:41.612 --> 00:02:44.310
"No," Bobby said.

36
00:02:44.311 --> 00:02:47.601
"It bounced before it reached the blue line."

37
00:02:47.602 --> 00:02:51.873
He was about to say, "You got a zero too."

38
00:02:51.874 --> 00:02:55.529
But Miss Shelly was giving him a warning look.

39
00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:58.771
"My turn," Izzie said.

40
00:02:58.772 --> 00:03:01.675
First she hit the tee.

41
00:03:01.676 --> 00:03:05.242
Then she missed.

42
00:03:05.243 --> 00:03:09.301
Finally she hit a home run!

43
00:03:09.302 --> 00:03:13.400
"Yeah, Izzie!" Nina cheered.

44
00:03:13.401 --> 00:03:16.218
Ethan was next.

45
00:03:16.219 --> 00:03:19.093
He hit a home run on his first try!

46
00:03:19.094 --> 00:03:22.413
"All right!" he said, nodding.

47
00:03:22.414 --> 00:03:26.407
On his second try, he hit another home run!

48
00:03:26.408 --> 00:03:31.503
"Yeah!" He narrowed his eyes and got ready for his last try.

49
00:03:31.504 --> 00:03:33.112
Home run!

50
00:03:33.113 --> 00:03:39.782
"Woo-hoo! Beat that!" he said to Bobby.

51
00:03:39.783 --> 00:03:41.403
"Don't worry. I will," Bobby said, taking the bat.

52
00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.196
He took a deep breath.

53
00:03:47.197 --> 00:03:50.033
He did not want to let Ethan beat him.

54
00:03:50.034 --> 00:03:54.331
The Home Run Derby was his favorite major league baseball event.

55
00:03:54.332 --> 00:03:56.684
He had to win!

56
00:03:56.685 --> 00:04:00.844
Whack! Whack! Whack!

57
00:04:00.845 --> 00:04:03.732
Bobby easily hit three home runs.

58
00:04:03.733 --> 00:04:08.604
"Ha!" he said. "Now what, Miss Shelly?"

59
00:04:08.605 --> 00:04:11.513
"Now we have a tiebreaker.

60
00:04:11.514 --> 00:04:17.420
You and Ethan each get two more tries," she said.

61
00:04:17.421 --> 00:04:19.313
Ethan went first.

62
00:04:19.314 --> 00:04:21.751
He hit the ball way up in the air.

63
00:04:21.752 --> 00:04:25.634
It landed close to the blue line, but not past it.

64
00:04:25.635 --> 00:04:29.784
Then whack! He hit the ball again.

65
00:04:29.785 --> 00:04:31.636
A home run!

66
00:04:31.637 --> 00:04:34.396
"Not bad," he said, grinning.

67
00:04:34.397 --> 00:04:36.738
He passed the bat to Bobby.

68
00:04:36.739 --> 00:04:41.225
Bobby gripped the bat and swung. Home run!

69
00:04:41.226 --> 00:04:45.029
Bobby swung again. Home run!

70
00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:49.738
"I'm the Home Run Derby champion!" he cheered.

71
00:04:49.739 --> 00:04:52.194
"You're pretty good," Ethan said.

72
00:04:52.195 --> 00:04:54.048
He stuck out his hand.

73
00:04:54.049 --> 00:04:56.377
The boys shook hands.

74
00:04:56.378 --> 00:05:03.752
"You're not so bad either," Bobby said.

75
00:05:03.753 --> 00:05:15.349
[caption_out@
